{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Use at least 55 unique words in the response. translate this to Russian: \"CPD is a generalization of PCA to higher order array and represents a $d$-mode tensor $\\mathcal{X} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_1 \\times n_2 \\times \\ldots \\times n_d}$ as a combination of rank-one tensors $[37]$. $$ \\mathcal{X}=\\sum_{r=1}^R \\lambda_r \\mathbf{a}_r^{(1)} \\otimes \\mathbf{a}_r^{(2)} \\otimes \\ldots \\otimes \\mathbf{a}_r^{(d)}, $$ where $R$ is a positive integer, $\\lambda_r$ is the weight of the $r$ th rank-one tensor, $\\mathbf{a}_r^{(i)} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_i}$ is the $r$ th factor of $i$ th mode with unit norm where $i \\in[d]$ and $r \\in[R]$. \""}],"model":"qwen38-27b","max_tokens":32768}